  "description": "Declarative animation for .NET MAUI — XAML keyframe timelines with CSS easing syntax (springs included), seekable/reversible playback, choreographed storyboards, trigger actions, animated visual-state transitions, implicit property transitions, item transitions, Keyframe page transitions, reduced motion by default, a vsync clock, and an animation layer that never breaks bindings, styles or visual states.",
